        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825080/extras/aad8f1e7d9b2712ed473b60b9ad63ecd.poster.avif?t=1776194331\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825080/extras/aad8f1e7d9b2712ed473b60b9ad63ecd.webm?t=1776194331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825080/extras/aad8f1e7d9b2712ed473b60b9ad63ecd.mp4?t=1776194331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Sanguine</i>, a survival horror experience that revives the terrifying spirit of the late 90s. Step into the ruined town of <strong>Craven Oaks</strong>, where something inhuman has been unleashed. To survive, you must scavenge, fight, solve puzzles, and piece together the fragments of your past before the <i>Bloods</i> consume everything. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic PSX Survival Horror</strong> – Fixed camera angles, tank controls, and authentic low-poly visuals deliver an unsettling retro experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Gameplay Modes</strong> – Play your way with both <strong>Classic</strong> (fixed camera angles) and <strong>Modern</strong> (third-person, over-the-shoulder) perspectives, each offering a distinct survival experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Interwoven Campaigns</strong> – Experience the nightmare from different perspectives in two playable campaigns, each with unique stories that unfold across the same haunting events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor Stories Mode</strong> – Tackle a replayable Arcade challenge featuring strict time limits, randomized layouts, shifting objectives, and character-specific loadouts, all built for fast-paced survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong> – Every bullet counts. Scavenge, craft, and manage your inventory to endure the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Variety</strong> – From knives to shotguns, discover and upgrade weapons to fight back against the enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story &amp; Puzzles</strong> – Unravel a mystery woven through intricate puzzles, environmental storytelling, and chilling encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong> – Dynamic lighting, ambient effects, and a haunting soundscape heighten tension at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Music &amp; Cutscenes</strong> – Cinematic sequences and a unique soundtrack draw you deeper into the horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found Footage Discovery</strong> – Collect live-action VHS tapes, filmed in real life and spliced into the game, to uncover hidden truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong> – Test your skills and uncover secrets as you progress.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story &amp; Characters:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Kris</strong>, a survivor pulled from the wreckage of a car crash with no memory of who she is. Stranded in Craven Oaks, she discovers a community torn apart by a nightmare born from <strong>AlTran Corporation’s shadowy experiments</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kris</strong>: Strong-willed yet vulnerable, her amnesia makes every step a battle between survival and self-discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bloods</strong>: Hive-minded parasites that seize human hosts, twisting them into relentless, monstrous forms. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AlTran Corporation</strong>: Led by the enigmatic <strong>Dr. Gabriel Altran</strong>, the company’s grip on Craven Oaks hides dark secrets buried beneath its pursuit of innovation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Kris navigates the town, she’ll encounter other survivors—some allies, some threats. Each choice and alliance could mean the difference between survival and assimilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town itself becomes an enemy: from the quiet diner where it all begins, to abandoned streets, sewer tunnels, and the looming AlTran headquarters, every corner hides danger and revelation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Sanguine?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sanguine</i> isn’t just a clear love letter to <i>the 90's classics</i>—it’s a modern reimagining. By blending <strong>retro aesthetics, atmospheric design, live-action VHS tapes, and branching story choices</strong>, the game offers a nostalgic yet fresh horror experience built for fans of true survival horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now, survive later—if you can.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825080/extras/aad8f1e7d9b2712ed473b60b9ad63ecd.poster.avif?t=1776194331\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825080/extras/aad8f1e7d9b2712ed473b60b9ad63ecd.webm?t=1776194331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825080/extras/aad8f1e7d9b2712ed473b60b9ad63ecd.mp4?t=1776194331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Sanguine</i>, a survival horror experience that revives the terrifying spirit of the late 90s. Step into the ruined town of <strong>Craven Oaks</strong>, where something inhuman has been unleashed. To survive, you must scavenge, fight, solve puzzles, and piece together the fragments of your past before the <i>Bloods</i> consume everything. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic PSX Survival Horror</strong> – Fixed camera angles, tank controls, and authentic low-poly visuals deliver an unsettling retro experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Gameplay Modes</strong> – Play your way with both <strong>Classic</strong> (fixed camera angles) and <strong>Modern</strong> (third-person, over-the-shoulder) perspectives, each offering a distinct survival experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Interwoven Campaigns</strong> – Experience the nightmare from different perspectives in two playable campaigns, each with unique stories that unfold across the same haunting events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor Stories Mode</strong> – Tackle a replayable Arcade challenge featuring strict time limits, randomized layouts, shifting objectives, and character-specific loadouts, all built for fast-paced survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong> – Every bullet counts. Scavenge, craft, and manage your inventory to endure the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Variety</strong> – From knives to shotguns, discover and upgrade weapons to fight back against the enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story &amp; Puzzles</strong> – Unravel a mystery woven through intricate puzzles, environmental storytelling, and chilling encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong> – Dynamic lighting, ambient effects, and a haunting soundscape heighten tension at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Music &amp; Cutscenes</strong> – Cinematic sequences and a unique soundtrack draw you deeper into the horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found Footage Discovery</strong> – Collect live-action VHS tapes, filmed in real life and spliced into the game, to uncover hidden truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong> – Test your skills and uncover secrets as you progress.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story &amp; Characters:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Kris</strong>, a survivor pulled from the wreckage of a car crash with no memory of who she is. Stranded in Craven Oaks, she discovers a community torn apart by a nightmare born from <strong>AlTran Corporation’s shadowy experiments</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kris</strong>: Strong-willed yet vulnerable, her amnesia makes every step a battle between survival and self-discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bloods</strong>: Hive-minded parasites that seize human hosts, twisting them into relentless, monstrous forms. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AlTran Corporation</strong>: Led by the enigmatic <strong>Dr. Gabriel Altran</strong>, the company’s grip on Craven Oaks hides dark secrets buried beneath its pursuit of innovation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Kris navigates the town, she’ll encounter other survivors—some allies, some threats. Each choice and alliance could mean the difference between survival and assimilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town itself becomes an enemy: from the quiet diner where it all begins, to abandoned streets, sewer tunnels, and the looming AlTran headquarters, every corner hides danger and revelation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Sanguine?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sanguine</i> isn’t just a clear love letter to <i>the 90's classics</i>—it’s a modern reimagining. By blending <strong>retro aesthetics, atmospheric design, live-action VHS tapes, and branching story choices</strong>, the game offers a nostalgic yet fresh horror experience built for fans of true survival horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now, survive later—if you can.</p>",
